adding: 2px;border-radius: 4px;color: #fff;margin-left: 3px;\">\n          bug\n        </span>\n        <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;background-color: #B8B8B8;padding: 2px;border-radius: 4px;color: #fff;margin-left: 3px;\">\n          need-more-info\n        </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  <div class=\"github-row\">\n    <p class=\"github-body-container\">### Information about bug\n\nIn Purchase, we invoiced a service item, the cost is <span class=\"show-more-container\"><a href=\"\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"show-more\">…</a></span><span class=\"excerpt hidden\">added under “Cost of Goods Sold”. Here we are not selling that service. How can i nullify that balance under “Cost of Goods Sold”. Provisional Accounting enabled under Company.\nAs we referred documentation, different accounts used. This was getting confused.\n\n&lt;img width=\"941\" alt=\"Untitled1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c5f92518-f251-4d44-983e-e474e9b8d14f\" /&gt;\n&lt;img width=\"950\" alt=\"Untitled\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/24845e52-41f6-4497-8341-9d07a1b10be8\" /&gt;\n@ruthra-kumar @rohitwaghchaure \n\n### Module\n\naccounts, buying\n\n### Version\n\nerpnext 14.70.6\nfrappe 14.85.1\n\n### Installation method\n\nNone\n\n### Relevant log output / Stack trace / Full Error Message.\n\n_No response_</span></p>\n  </div>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
